OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA fresh start to the day, but
OL,6,Fmany places dry with sunny spells.
OL,7,FCloudy skies for northern Scotland,
OL,8,Fwith outbreaks of rain through the
OL,9,Fday. Breezy here, but light winds
OL,10,Felsewhere and feeling warm in the
OL,11,Fsunshine come the afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA fine evening for most,
OL,14,Fthough rain will continue across
OL,15,Fnorthern Scotland. Overnight, cloud
OL,16,Fand patchy rain may also spread into
OL,17,Fparts of Northern Ireland. Dry
OL,18,Felsewhere, with clear skies.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
